    {
      "id": "c-beishi-016-yuanzhan-falun:p000",
      "text": "湛弟瑾，尚書祠部郎。後謀殺齊文襄。事泄，合門伏法。",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "id": "c-beishi-016-yuanzhan-falun:p000:m0000",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 1,
          "surface": "湛",
          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "2a3_ci1_y4y",
          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "「湛弟瑾」以廣陽文獻王湛指明元瑾之兄。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-beishi-016-yuanzhan-falun:p001",
      "text": "湛子法輪，紫光所生也。齊王矜湛覆滅，乃啟原之，復其爵土。",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "mentions": [
